  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Make the crumble: put all the crumble ingredients in a mixer bowl and mix with the paddle to fine crumbs. Cover and rest in the freezer or fridge for 15 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 200°C and line a wide tray with baking paper. Toss the sliced portobello, halved shiitake, sliced zucchini and roughly chopped chard with the salt, pepper, olive oil and chilli and spread on the tray."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roast for 10 to 12 minutes until the vegetables soften. Lower the oven to 170°C."
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the vegetables to a Pyrex or ceramic ovenproof dish, scatter the crumble evenly over the top and bake for 15 to 20 minutes."
    }
  ]
